---
// Source: Campaign Operating Manual, Chapters 6 and 11 — Who Are The
// Builders / The Heart of TECHMED.
---

<section class="section">
  <h2>Who Are The Builders?</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Students who join TECHMED are not "members." Not "followers." Not
    "subscribers." They are <strong>Builders</strong> — because Builders
    create, improve, stay committed, and return after failure.
  </p>

  <blockquote>
    "I am not preparing only for UTME. I am building the person who will
    succeed long after UTME."
  </blockquote>

  <p class="build-label">Every Builder is building far more than exam success:</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="item reveal">
      <h3>Knowledge</h3>
      <p>Not memorization. Understanding.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="item reveal">
      <h3>Discipline</h3>
      <p>Showing up even when motivation disappears.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="item reveal">
      <h3>Confidence</h3>
      <p>Earned through preparation. Never borrowed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="item reveal">
      <h3>Character</h3>
      <p>Integrity, curiosity, humility, consistency.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="item reveal">
      <h3>Systems</h3>
      <p>Study plans, revision methods, reflection habits.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="item reveal">
      <h3>The Future</h3>
      <p>UTME is one chapter. Not the entire story.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

